<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda ua Paulu kuli Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda ua Paulu kuli</para>
  <para style="mt1">FILIMONI</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Livulu eli lia lihi lia Filimoni valisonekele kuli kanganda Paulu (1:1) Paulu uakele nakusoneka eli livulu oku tele ali mu kamenga, eci cimuesa ngeci cilivene uakele nakulisonekela mu Loma. Nga uakele mu Loma kaha ualisonekele ha miaka yakupua makumi atanu na miaka likumi na umo (61) hanima yakusemuka ca Kilistu, eyi ikeyo vene ntsimbu imo lika ije yasonekele naua na mukanda ua Kolose.</para>
  <para style="ip">Uasonekele ou mukanda kuli yala ivatumbula nguavo Filimoni. Filimoni uapuile umo ua vantu va mu cikungulukilo kaha naua uapuile muka kufuka vandungo. Paulu uasonekelele kuli ikeye mukumulomba ngeci keti ahane kashitiko ndungo yendi Onesimasi uje uateuele kuhuma kuli Filimoni. Kuya ku lishiko lia vaka Loma, Filimoni uakele na nzili ya kutsiha Onesimasi. Paulu ali nakulikuasesa mezi akulambelela linga akolese Filimoni ngeci atambule Onesimasi kupua ngue muanaye muli Kilistu, kaha ali nakusinganieka naua nguendi Onesimasi amutavese kupangela hamo na Paulu 1:13-14</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulu ameneka Filimoni 1:1-3</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Paulu alombelako Onesimasi linga vamutambule ngue muanaye muli Kilistu 1:4-21</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Paulu amanusula nakuhandeka vutumbe vuendi vua kuvamenekela nakutuma vihindu 1:22-25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Yange Paulu cinzinda ua Kilistu Yesu, njili na Timateo muanetu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Tulina kusonekela kuli Filimoni ua cizango mukuetu mu vipangi, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />na kuli Afiya muanetu uampuevo na kuli mukuetu lisualale Alikipase, naku cikungulukilo cije cili mu njivo yove.<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Njambi Tatetu na Muene Yesu Kilistu vamihane kavumbi na ciyulo.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cizango ca Filimoni na lutsilielo luendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Njikatsantsela kuli Njambi yange ntsimbu yoshe omo njikavuluka mu malombelo ange, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />muomu njivua cizango cove na lutsilielo luje ulinaluo hali Muene Yesu na ku vantu vakulela voshe va Njambi, <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />kaha njilomba nguange kulipangela ca lulitsilielo luove case kutualalutue mana aviacili vioshe vije vinapu vietu muli Kilistu. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Muomu njinauana nzolela yakama cikuma na kuzembeleka ku cizango cove, muanetu muomu mitima ya vantu vakulela va Njambi vanavuahelela muacili kuhitila muli yove.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu alomba Filimoni linga atambule naua Onesimasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Kuya mucinailamo, cipue vene nguavo njasimpi cikuma muli Kilistu mu kukushika linga upange vije vitondeka, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />vuno honi muomu ya cizango njilina kulomba kuli yove, yange Paulu yala ua mukuluntu kaha honi naua cinzinda ua Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Njilina kulomba kuli yove omo ya munange Onesimasi, uje napu munange oku tele njicili mu kamenga. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Ha ntsimbu yakunima uapuile uakuhona seho kuli yove, vuno hano honi alinaseho kuli yove nange.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Njilina kumutuma linga ahiluke kuli yove, ikeye mutima uange uoshe. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Ngue njinavuahelela kukala nendi hamo nange, linga ase kunjipangela cipangi cije ciunapandele kupanga yove oku njicili mu kamenga muomu ya Muzimbu Uacili. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Vuno honi kunjitondo kulinga cimo kuakuhona yove kunjitavesa, linga honi vucili vuove keti vupue ngue vuakukuzangesa vuno honi vua kucizango cove vavenia.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Mpamo eci cikeco canehesele ngeci Onesimasi ahangunuke kuli yove muka ntsimbu lika, linga ukakale nove naua ntsimbu yoshe, <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />keti honi ikeye ndungo vuno honi napulakana ndungo, ikeye muanetu ua cizango, nga kuli yange cinafu muje, kaha kuli yove cikafua vati honi, muoshe mu vuntu na muli Muene.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Nankuma nga unjitanda nguove njimukueni muka kupanga, kaha mutambule ngue muje munapande kutambuilamo yange. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Nga amipihisila cipue kumikonguela cuma coshe, yange njikamifuetavio. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Yange Paulu njisoneka evi na livoko liange, njikavifueta. Kuakuhona kuhandeka cimo ku vije viuakonguele kuli yange. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Eyo, Muanetu, njitonda linga unjilingileko eci muli Muene. Vuahelesa mutima uange muli Kilistu.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Kusimpa ca kuononoka cove, njilina kukusonekela evi omo njazivuka nguange ukalinga viakama cikuma kupulakana evi njilinakuhandeka. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Ha ntsimbu imo lika vene, njivuaheseleni mu njivo ya vangenzi, omo njatsiliela nguange kuhitila mu malombelo eni nange naua hamo njikahiluka kuli yeni.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vihindu via mamanusuilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafalase, mukuetu cinzinda muli Kilistu Yesu, natumu vihindu kuli yeni,<verse eid="PHM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Kaha na Mako vene, na Alisitakase, na Ndemase, na Luka, vakuetu mu vipangi na vakevo vanatumu vihindu.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Kavumbi ka Muene Yesu Kilistu kakale na cimbembesi ceni.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>